## Download

The latest version of **Vivo Calendar Global** is available in the **Releases** section.

## Installation

1. Download the APK from **Releases**.
2. Allow installation of apps from unknown sources.
3. Install the application.
4. On first launch, grant calendar access and other permissions requested by the application.

## Updates

Changes, fixes and new features are listed in the release notes for each version.

## Disclaimer

Vivo Calendar Global is an independent project and is not an official vivo application.

